# Data Layer Conventions

## Domain Models (freezed)

- Use `freezed` for all domain models in the `domain/` package.
- Models must be immutable; use `copyWith` for mutations.
- Use `@freezed` with a sealed union for entities that have multiple states.

```dart
@freezed
class Trip with _$Trip {
  const factory Trip({
    required String id,
    required String destination,
  }) = _Trip;
}
```

## DTOs (json_serializable)

- DTOs live in `data/` and are used only for API serialization/deserialization.
- Use `@JsonSerializable(fieldRename: FieldRename.snake)` to map snake_case JSON to camelCase Dart.
- Always include `fromJson` factory and `toJson` method.
- DTOs must not leak into `domain/` or `features/` — map them to domain models in repositories.

```dart
@JsonSerializable(fieldRename: FieldRename.snake)
class TripDto {
  const TripDto({required this.id, required this.destinationName});
  final String id;
  final String destinationName;

  factory TripDto.fromJson(Map<String, dynamic> json) => _$TripDtoFromJson(json);
  Map<String, dynamic> toJson() => _$TripDtoToJson(this);
}
```

## API Clients (retrofit + dio)

- Define API interfaces using `@RestApi` and `retrofit`.
- Use `@GET`, `@POST`, `@PUT`, `@DELETE`, `@Path`, `@Query`, `@Body` annotations.
- Configure Dio (interceptors, base URL, headers) in a `@module` DI registration.

## Code Generation (build_runner)

After modifying files with `freezed`, `json_serializable`, `injectable`, or `auto_route` annotations, run:

```shell
fvm dart run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs
```

- Never edit generated files (`.freezed.dart`, `.g.dart`, `.gr.dart`, `injectable.config.dart`) manually.
- Commit generated files to version control.

## Logging

Use `dart:developer` `log()` — never `print()`:

```dart
import 'dart:developer' as developer;

developer.log('Fetching trips', name: 'data.trips');

try {
  // ...
} catch (e, s) {
  developer.log('Failed to fetch trips', name: 'data.trips', error: e, stackTrace: s);
}
```

## Package Management

- Add dependency: `fvm flutter pub add <package>`
- Add dev dependency: `fvm flutter pub add dev:<package>`
- Remove dependency: `fvm dart pub remove <package>`
